{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119681","id":3733580382,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7eiepe","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119681","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119681.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119681.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119681","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119681/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119681/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119681/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/48b60306ec2c6f7ec7c88ca6c9726e9690460762","number":119681,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix Curve point count expansion preserving points","user":{"login":"emanueledenaro","id":79084923,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MDg0OTIz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/79084923?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/emanueledenaro","html_url":"https://github.com/emanueledenaro","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emanueledenaro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emanueledenaro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emanueledenaro/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emanueledenaro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emanueledenaro/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emanueledenaro/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emanueledenaro/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emanueledenaro/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emanueledenaro/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\n\n- Closes #119660\n\nWhen the Inspector adds a new point to a `Curve`, it stores the current indexed point properties, increases `point_count`, then reapplies those properties. `Curve::set_point_count()` was using `_add_point(Vector2())` for the newly-created slot. Since `_add_point()` keeps points sorted by offset, adding a default `(0, 0)` point could shift existing indexed points before the Inspector restored their values, making the first point appear reset.\n\nThis changes `Curve::set_point_count()` to create new points at the end of the curve domain when expanding an existing curve. That keeps existing indexed slots stable while still using `_add_point()` for point initialization, sorting, tangent updates, and dirty-state handling.\n\nAI-assisted contribution: AI tooling was used for issue triage, implementation drafting, and local test orchestration.\n\nTests:\n- `scons platform=macos target=editor tests=yes vulkan=no angle=no accesskit=no ccflags=-fmodules-cache-path=/private/tmp/godot-clang-module-cache -j4`\n- `HOME=/private/tmp/godot-test-home ./bin/godot.macos.editor.arm64 --headless --test --test-case=\"[Curve] Expanding point count should preserve existing indexed point properties\"`\n- `HOME=/private/tmp/godot-test-home ./bin/godot.macos.editor.arm64 --headless --test --test-case=\"[Curve]*\"`\n- `HOME=/private/tmp/godot-test-home ./bin/godot.macos.editor.arm64 --headless --test --test-case=\"[Curve2D]*\" --test-case=\"[Curve3D]*\"`\n- `/private/tmp/godot-prek-venv/bin/prek run --show-diff-on-failure --files scene/resources/curve.cpp tests/scene/test_curve.cpp`\n- `git diff --check`\n\n## Additional information\n\nThe test mirrors the Inspector's property replay sequence: read indexed point properties, expand `point_count`, then set the old indexed properties back. It also checks that the existing indexed positions are preserved immediately after expanding.\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==